    "group": "Forgefather's Seekers",
    "summary": "You may call Devastator Doctrine once more over the battle. Friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES ranged attacks gain 1 Strength against targets no farther than 12 inches away. Fielding VULKAN HE’STAN lets your INFERNUS SQUAD units start an action even if selected to [Fall Back](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) or to Advance. Starting one of these actions also leaves them eligible to shoot. SALAMANDERS are allowed, with other chapter-specific ADEPTUS ASTARTES excluded.",
